From 7934242e97fc4338286446b7814dc9af3f6ecf5b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Daniel <daniel@teide.tech>
Date: Fri, 2 Oct 2026 02:26:09 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 13/13] S8: s8CaptureToSampler (render a deck's loop with stem
 volumes into a sampler)

Decodes the loop (or beatloop_size beats from the beat at the playhead)
from the file, mixes the stems with their current volume and mute, writes a
float WAV to Music/Mixxx/Music/Samples/Captures and loads it into the
sampler with a constant-tempo grid at the deck's BPM (locked), repeat,
quantize and sync on. Render on a worker thread, library/player on the main
thread. PlayerManager and TrackCollectionManager are registered for this.

Co-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>
